Provenance of native compiler/runtime support
=============================================

The shell's LICENSE.txt does not replace the notices for these BSD/UNIX
components. Original file notices have been retained.

crt0-stack.s: /usr/src/lib/libc/pdp/csu/crt0.s, with local stack prefaulting.
csv-stack.s: /usr/src/lib/libc/pdp/crt/csv.s, with local stack prefaulting.
DEFS.h: unchanged /usr/src/lib/libc/pdp/crt/DEFS.h.
from-host/: source and existing compiler objects from /usr/src/lib/ccom.
All were obtained from the tested 2.11BSD patch-level-498 system.
The SHA256 manifest records the unchanged compiler snapshot, including objects.

